ile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wqwY7vmc46agHqvC2AyqMkxapLP.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Fai bei sogni","overview":"A nove anni Massimo perde la mamma per un infarto improvviso - o almeno così gli dicono i parenti, riluttanti a renderlo partecipe della morte della donna. Dopo un'infanzia solitaria e un'adolescenza difficile Massimo diventa un giornalista affermato ma continua a convivere con il ricordo lacerante della madre scomparsa, nonché con un senso di mistero circa la sua improvvisa dipartita. Solo alla fine scoprirà come sono andate esattamente le cose, e troverà il modo di risalire alla luce."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Sweet Dreams","overview":"Turin, 1969. Nine-year-old Massimo’s idyllic childhood is shattered by the mysterious death of his mother. The young boy refuses to accept this brutal loss, even if the priest says she is now in Heaven. Years later in the 90s, adult Massimo has become an accomplished journalist. After reporting on the war in Sarajevo, he begins to suffer from panic attacks. As he prepares to sell his parents’ apartment, Massimo is forced to relive his traumatic past. Compassionate doctor Elisa could help tormented Massimo open up and confront his childhood wounds…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tTi1v2zgUtb7tQOw1JqJrebvroa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lOlMW38YoOJd4WxFIGf2KbzCrCQ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":394260,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tTi1v2zgUtb7tQOw1JqJrebvroa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tTi1v2zgUtb7tQOw1JqJrebvroa.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.